  "notes": "Operating temperature footnote: module turns up from cold start at ambient as low as -5C and reaches specifications after self-heating to min temperature (+15C). Tx power minimum 1dBm without attenuation; provisionable attenuation up to 10dB from maximum available Tx power; defaults to maximum if not provisioned by host. Tx Out-Of-Band OSNR listed as TBD. Rx sensitivity values measured at OSNR > 36dB. Rx @ OSNR and Rx OSNR @~1dB penalty footnote: specified as [Min OSNR Value @ Min Rx power for the OSNR value]. Absolute max: Rx signal input power +1dBm; Rx total input power 15dBm. Power consumption EOL: see ELECTICAL CHARACTERISTICS; increases with host interface and with extended CD search range beyond default. DP-QPSK FWHM 113GHz noted in OVERVIEW. Non-Muxponder mode and additional max CD range power figures TBD in electrical table.",
